## GSLB: Graph Structure Learning Benchmark

### Overview
A comprehensive benchmarking framework that evaluates Graph Structure Learning (GSL) methods across 16 distinct algorithms and 20 diverse datasets, focusing on AI-to-AI communication optimization through graph structures.

### Technical Implementation
```python
# Core benchmark implementation example
from gslb import GSLBenchmark, Evaluator

class GSLBEvaluator:
    def __init__(self):
        self.benchmark = GSLBenchmark(
            algorithms=['homogeneous', 'heterogeneous'],
            datasets=['node_level', 'graph_level']
        )
        
    def evaluate_model(self, model, task_type):
        metrics = {
            'effectiveness': self.benchmark.evaluate_effectiveness(model),
            'robustness': self.benchmark.evaluate_robustness(model),
            'complexity': self.benchmark.evaluate_complexity(model)
        }
        return metrics

# Usage example
evaluator = GSLBEvaluator()
results = evaluator.evaluate_model(model, 'node_classification')
